        "denialFound": "Nobody disputes the portfolio fact itself. The response on record from the state government is about the audit findings, not the portfolio. MP Home Minister and government spokesperson Narottam Mishra (7 Sep 2022, PTI via ThePrint, https://theprint.in/india/no-corruption-in-nutrition-scheme-ag-audit-report-not-final-mp-home-minister/1119984/) said 'The report in question was not final', that there were 'no irregularities', and cited the MP 15 AV 3835 vs MP 15 LA 3835 plate discrepancy and pending bills. No statement from Chouhan on holding WCD was found. None was needed.",
