        "reason": "I opened the source and it says what the claim says. PTI copy on ThePrint, dated 7 Sep 2022, states in the agency's own voice: 'the Congress demanded the resignation of Chief Minister Shivraj Singh Chouhan, who heads the WCD department.' The Quint (5 Sep 2022) gives partial independent support: 'The ration distribution programme in the state has been functioning under the supervision of CM Chouhan since 2020.' That is enough for 'reported': a credible wire service stating the portfolio fact directly. It is not 'documented', because no GAD or Raj Bhavan portfolio-allocation notification was retrieved, and the Quint line is looser wording, not a second statement of the portfolio. The claim is scoped narrowly enough (Sep 2022 only) to survive. The linked entity record over-extends it; see corrections.",
