          "c066: set from=\"2023-06-12\" and mark it as \"on or before; notice-served date, order date not public\". Change the label to \"MHA suspended FCRA registration of CARE India Solutions for Sustainable Development (CISSD) for 180 days, notice served by 2023-06-12\". Remove \"(₹377.5 crore foreign funding 2021-22)\" from the claim text, or rephrase it as context: \"surveyed by IT 2022-09-07; ₹377.5 cr FC in 2021-22 per auditor\". Replace the primary source with TOI 2023-06-13 (https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mha-suspends-fcra-licence-of-care-india-over-violations/articleshow/100947304.cms). Keep ET 2023-06-13 (https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/india/care-indias-fcra-licence-suspended-over-alleged-violations/articleshow/100956600.cms) and The CSR Universe as derivatives, not as independent sources. In d, change \"Stated grounds (The CSR Universe)\" to \"Auditor's certificate (per TOI), not MHA's stated order ground\". Add: \"condonation plea filed with MHA; ₹5.6 crore penalty provided in 2018 accounts\". Add: \"registration renewed w.e.f. 2022-10-01 (ET 2023-03-24, https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/india/mha-extends-fcra-licence-of-care-india-by-five-years/articleshow/98951749.cms)\". Set a to null, or relabel it as \"auditor-flagged 2012-13 receipt\", not the amount at issue in the order. Check killIf/supersession against the OdishaBytes 2024-02-28 report that CARE wound up operations after the suspension. c068: replace the quoted paraphrases with CARE's actual email quote to TOI. Entity ngo:care-india: add alias \"CARE India Solutions for Sustainable Development (CISSD)\". Change ty from trust to company (Section 8 / not-for-profit company; CIN still unverified). Fix sub to \"FCRA renewed w.e.f. 2022-10-01; suspended 180 days 2023-06\" and drop the unsourced \"~4,000 job losses\" unless a source is added. Set the entity source to TOI. c067: attribute the ground to the auditor's certificate as reported by TOI, not to MHA."
