        "innocentReading": "This was a routine compliance review triggered by WVI's 2021 renewal application. MHA looks back over nine years of annual returns and queries accounting or utilisation irregularities, which is normal for a large recipient (₹170 crore in 2022). Recording the allegation says nothing about whether it is true. The orders were never published and never adjudicated, and WVI says it answered every query with documents.",
