          "1. lab: \"MoS (PMO/Personnel) V. Narayanasamy said MHA had cancelled 'operating licences' of three of 12 unnamed Kudankulam-area NGOs under scrutiny, 2012-02-24 (UPA)\". Drop \"FCRA registrations\" unless an MHA record says so. 2. tier: reported -> alleged for the s=ngo:mha-foreigners-division enforce edge. Alternatively, set s=wel:v-narayanasamy (or a statement node) and keep reported. 3. Add a contra: Chidambaram 2012-02-29, bank accounts of four NGOs frozen and cases filed by CBI/TN police, no cancellations mentioned (DH https://www.deccanherald.com/india/pc-says-more-ngos-scanner-2317244). Add DH 2012-02-28 (https://www.deccanherald.com/content/230728/4-ngos-booked-funding-protests.html) as a second source for the \"12 NGOs\" scrutiny and the four cases. 4. d: note that the associations are unnamed and there are no FCRA registration numbers, so identity is unresolved. 5. upgradeIf: keep the requirement for a Parliament answer or MHA Annual Report 2011-12 naming the associations and the cancellation orders. killIf: add \"MHA or Parliament record shows only freezes or prior-permission for the Kudankulam cluster in 2012-02, and no cancellations\"."
