        "denialFound": "World Vision International statement by Pradeep Daniel, 19 Jan 2024, at https://www.wvi.org/newsroom/world-visions-globally-funded-programming-in-india. It says WV is \"profoundly disappointed\", that WVI \"has been unable to receive international funds into the bank account designated to receive them since November 2022\", that the cancellation \"only affects our internationally-funded work\", and that WVI \"is registered under the Tamil Nadu Societies Registration Act, with its own Board of Directors\". The Hindu also quotes WVI's financial statement, which says it \"has submitted its detailed responses to the MHA for all matters raised ... relating to the periods from 2012-13 to 2020-21\". Neither disputes the ₹170 cr figure. It is not known whether The Hindu put the figure to WVI.",
