        "reason": "The Hindu original confirms the amount and the recipient: \"In 2022, WVI received around ₹170 crore in foreign donations from its partners in the U.S., Switzerland, and Germany, among others\". The edge as built does not hold. It records a ₹170 cr grant from ngo:world-vision-international, but the source attributes the money to several unnamed partners in several countries, not to the parent. The source node, and so the edge's meaning, is unsupported. The fact of the receipt survives at the reported tier: one credible outlet, a named reporter, and a figure apparently drawn from WVI's own statements. It does not survive as a grant edge from WV International.",
