        "denialFound": "A response exists, in the same source. Believers Church spokesperson Fr Sijo Panthapallil: \"Our FCRA registrations are under revision for the last one year. They had sent us a letter asking for documents and we have submitted the required documents\" and \"We are sure that we will get the registrations back next week.\" This is recorded as c041. It describes the process and expects restoration; it does not deny that the registrations were cancelled or suspended. MHA gave no stated ground in the piece, and whether MHA was asked for comment is unknown.",
